abstract: >-
  This repository contains the manuscript source and supporting materials for
  the November 15, 2026 certified constructive N-Series manuscript and
  reproducibility evidence. The revision separates classical Richardson
  cancellation, algebraic chord tripling, and exact-operation constructible
  approximation; it includes an 80-decimal exact-rational certificate and
  a separately verified Lean constructive-ladder checkpoint.

